{
  "id": 8834807234759,
  "title": "Norse Mythology Quilt with Ravens",
  "handle": "norse-mythology-quilt-with-ravens-b8220cc38c-b8220cc38c",
  "body_html": "<p>Elevate your bedroom with the Jeminise Norse mythology quilt, where ancient legend meets modern comfort. Featuring a highly detailed symmetrical ravens and Vegvisir compass design, this quilt adds a striking, symbolic touch to your home decor. Crafted from soft, breathable polyester fabric with a high-quality silk floss fill, it offers lightweight warmth and cozy durability for all seasons.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Customizable Design:</strong> Personalize your quilt with custom options, including adding a name or selecting optional matching pillowcases.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Premium Materials:</strong> Crafted with a soft polyester outer layer and filled with high-quality silk floss for exceptional comfort and breathability.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Viking Raven Theme:</strong> Features a unique Norse mythology design displaying symmetrical ravens, Vegvisir compass, Yggdrasil tree, and runic alphabet line art.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Perfect as a bed quilt, throw blanket, or travel companion for camping and picnics.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Conveniently machine washable in cold water; dries quickly to maintain its soft and fluffy texture.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fill Material</th>\n<td>Silk Floss</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Tree of Life, Viking</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Viking Pattern</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Viking Decor</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>Name &amp; size options</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All Season</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
